WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.382
When Katie came clunking into Ms. Barrow’s classroom, everyone turned and stared.

2
00:00:07.383 --> 00:00:12.728
She was wearing Western boots, jeans, and a cowgirl hat.

3
00:00:12.729 --> 00:00:15.973
She had tied a scarf around her neck.

4
00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:23.232
"Where’s your lasso, partner?" asked Larry. Everyone laughed.

5
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:24.828
Katie turned to Joy.

6
00:00:24.829 --> 00:00:28.425
"Get out the friendship meter," she said.

7
00:00:28.426 --> 00:00:32.184
"I think there’s some teasing going on."

8
00:00:32.185 --> 00:00:37.010
"It might be friendly teasing," said Joy with a smile.

9
00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:39.781
"Might be," said Katie.

10
00:00:39.782 --> 00:00:42.863
But she still didn’t like it.

11
00:00:42.864 --> 00:00:50.493
After lunch Ms. Barrow told Katie it was time for her presentation.

12
00:00:50.494 --> 00:00:56.687
"Finally!" she thought, walking to the front of the room. "Howdy, everyone."

13
00:00:56.688 --> 00:01:01.404
Then she asked the kids to think of different kinds of exercise.

14
00:01:01.405 --> 00:01:02.820
"You shout them out.

15
00:01:02.821 --> 00:01:05.334
I’ll write them on the board."

16
00:01:05.335 --> 00:01:08.788
"Baseball," said Carlos.

17
00:01:08.789 --> 00:01:11.772
"Biking," said Laura.

18
00:01:11.773 --> 00:01:14.760
"Swimming," said Luke.

19
00:01:14.761 --> 00:01:17.671
Katie wrote as fast as she could.

20
00:01:17.672 --> 00:01:23.250
"I’ll help you write," offered Olivia and hopped up from her desk.

21
00:01:23.251 --> 00:01:28.265
"Olivia and Katie are becoming good friends," thought Joy.

22
00:01:28.266 --> 00:01:38.312
The boys and girls continued: basketball, rock climbing, skateboarding, tennis, hiking, running.

23
00:01:38.313 --> 00:01:41.182
Soon the whiteboard was covered.

24
00:01:41.183 --> 00:01:48.961
"Nobody has mentioned my favorite kind of exercise—dancing!" said Katie.

25
00:01:48.962 --> 00:01:52.132
"Yuck," said Larry.

26
00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:56.773
"I’ve been studying muscles," Katie said to Larry.

27
00:01:56.774 --> 00:02:01.903
"It takes 17 muscles to smile and 43 to frown.

28
00:02:01.904 --> 00:02:04.284
So relax and SMILE!

29
00:02:04.285 --> 00:02:06.502
Dancing is fun!

30
00:02:06.503 --> 00:02:11.810
Now let’s push back the desks and square-dance!"

31
00:02:11.811 --> 00:02:14.134
Joy stepped to the front of the room.

32
00:02:14.135 --> 00:02:17.544
Luke and Carlos slowly followed her.

33
00:02:17.545 --> 00:02:20.519
"These are my helpers," said Katie.

34
00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.383
"We’ll show you the basic steps.

35
00:02:23.384 --> 00:02:28.074
And don’t worry. Square dancing isn’t hard.

36
00:02:28.075 --> 00:02:32.523
"You’ll do great," she whispered to Luke and Carlos.

37
00:02:32.524 --> 00:02:37.256
She knew they weren’t very happy about dancing in front of everyone.

38
00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.212
But they were good friends.

39
00:02:39.213 --> 00:02:42.091
It was nice of them to help her.

40
00:02:42.092 --> 00:02:46.662
"First, honor your partner," Katie called out.

41
00:02:46.663 --> 00:02:52.309
"Then circle left and circle right. Easy!"

42
00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:56.676
"We have to hold hands with the girls?" cried Larry.

43
00:02:56.677 --> 00:02:59.486
Katie pretended not to hear.

44
00:02:59.487 --> 00:03:04.882
Katie and her helpers showed how to skip to the center and promenade.

45
00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:08.101
They showed how to swing your partner.

46
00:03:08.102 --> 00:03:12.406
"Just hook elbows and go!" said Joy.

47
00:03:12.407 --> 00:03:14.592
"That’s it!" said Katie.

48
00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:17.039
"Who wants to try the first dance?

49
00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:21.151
Come on, Laura and Larry! Come on, Olivia!"

50
00:03:21.152 --> 00:03:24.653
Katie arranged eight dancers in a square.

51
00:03:24.654 --> 00:03:28.037
"What about you?" Larry asked.

52
00:03:28.038 --> 00:03:32.577
"Me?" said Katie. "I’m the square-dance caller!"

53
00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:35.205
Then she started the music.

54
00:03:35.206 --> 00:03:40.526
"Honor your partner!" called Katie as the first notes played.

55
00:03:40.527 --> 00:03:46.147
"Circle left!" The eight dancers grabbed hands and started circling.

56
00:03:46.148 --> 00:03:48.691
All join hands and circle left.

57
00:03:48.692 --> 00:03:51.227
All join hands and circle left.

58
00:03:51.228 --> 00:03:53.669
All join hands and circle left.

59
00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.929
Skip to my Lou, my darling.

60
00:03:56.930 --> 00:04:01.260
"Good job! Now circle right!" called Katie.

61
00:04:01.261 --> 00:04:03.826
The other way back in the same old track.

62
00:04:03.827 --> 00:04:06.312
The other way back in the same old track.

63
00:04:06.313 --> 00:04:08.739
The other way back in the same old track.

64
00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:12.791
Skip to my Lou, my darling.

65
00:04:12.792 --> 00:04:16.487
"Now promenade!"

66
00:04:16.488 --> 00:04:18.976
Skip, skip, skip to my Lou.

67
00:04:18.977 --> 00:04:21.567
Skip, skip, skip to my Lou.

68
00:04:21.568 --> 00:04:24.145
Skip, skip, skip to my Lou.

69
00:04:24.146 --> 00:04:27.831
Skip to my Lou, my darling.

70
00:04:27.832 --> 00:04:31.503
"Promenade back with an elbow swing!"

71
00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:34.249
Turn it ‘round and skip back home.

72
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.799
Turn it ‘round and skip back home.

73
00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.325
When you get home, swing your own.

74
00:04:39.326 --> 00:04:47.839
Skip to my Lou, my darling.

75
00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:53.297
When the music stopped, everyone was laughing.

76
00:04:53.298 --> 00:04:58.664
"That was wonderful, Katie!" cried Ms. Barrow, clapping her hands.

77
00:04:58.665 --> 00:05:02.660
"And Joy, you really know how to keep the beat!"

78
00:05:02.661 --> 00:05:07.751
"I think we need to try again," said Katie with a smile.

79
00:05:07.752 --> 00:05:09.800
"Let’s have two squares.

80
00:05:09.801 --> 00:05:14.280
Anyone who hasn’t danced, join in this time!"

81
00:05:14.281 --> 00:05:17.906
The boys and girls scrambled into place.

82
00:05:17.907 --> 00:05:23.185
Katie put one arm around Luke and the other around Carlos.

83
00:05:23.186 --> 00:05:25.157
"Thanks for helping, you guys.

84
00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:31.677
You are the best friends anyone could ask for!"

